config TINYML_APP_MOTION
	bool "Motion recognition"
	help
	  TinyMotion 1D-CNN motion-trajectory recognition on a raw accelerometer
	  window embedded in the firmware.  z-score + int8 quantization is done
	  in plain C (motion_preprocess.c); the model runs on the shared
	  ts_realtek engine with a confidence-threshold open-set gate.
